    "summary": "1–4, The Saints are called to gather at the Ohio.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [
      {
        "type": "introduction",
        "text": "Revelation given to Joseph Smith the Prophet and Sidney Rigdon, near Fayette, New York, December 1830. Herein is given the first commandment concerning a gathering in this dispensation."
      }
    ],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Behold, I say unto you that it is not expedient in me that ye should translate any more until ye shall go to the Ohio, and this because of the enemy and for your sakes.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 69,
            "end": 78,
            "text": "IE the translation of the Bible already in process. D&C 1:29; 35:20."
          }
